{title: Bawraa Mann Dekhne Chala Ek Sapna}
{artist: Swanand Kirkire}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E]Bawra Mann Dekhne [A]Chala Ek [E]Sapna,        [E]Bawra Mann Dekhne [A]Chala Ek [E]Sapna
[A]Baawre Se Mann Ki Dekho,        [E]Baawri Hain Baatein
[A]Baawre Se Mann Ki Dekho,        [E]Baawri Hain Baatein
[A]Baawri Si Dhadkaane Hain,        [B]Baawri Hain [E]Saansein
[F#]Baawri Si Karwaton Se,        [E]Nindiya Door Bhaage
[E]Baawre Se Na [B]in Chaahe,        [E]Baawre Jharo [B]khon Se,
[E]Baawre [A]Nazaaron Ko [B]Takna.        [E]Bawra Mann Dekhne [A]Chala Ek [E]Sapna
[E]Bawre Se Is Jahan Mein Bawra Ek,        [A]Saath [E]Ho
[E]Is Sayaani Bheed Main Bas,        [A]Haathon Mein Tera [E]Haath Ho
[F#]Baawri Si Dhun Ho Koi,        [E]Baawra Ek Raag Ho
[F#]Ooo.. Baawri Si Dhun Ho Koi,        [E]Baawra Ek Raag Ho
[E]Baawre Se Pa [B]ir Chahein,        [E]Baawre Tar [B]ano Ke,
[E]Baawre Se [A]Bol Pe [B]Thirakna.        [E]Bawra Mann Dekhne [A]Chala Ek [E]Sapna
[E]Baawra Sa Ho Andhera,Baawri,        Khaa [A]moshi [E]yan
[E]Baawra Sa Ho Andhera,Baawri,        Khaa [A]moshi [E]yan
[E]Thartharati Lau Ho Maddham,        [B]Baawri Mad [E]hoshiyan,
[E]Baawra Ek [B]Ghooghta Chahe,        [E]Haule Haule [B]Bin Bataye,
[E]Baawre Se [A]Mukhde Se [B]Sarakanaa,        [E]Bawra Mann Dekhne [A]Chala Ek [E]Sapna
